#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:3
msgid "服务管理：让训练一直跑，服务一直开"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:5
msgid "驱动装好了，远程能连上了——但这只是开始。真正的考验是：**你关掉笔记本电脑回家的路上，训练还在跑吗？**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:7
msgid "这一节解决两个核心问题：一是让任务在你离线后继续运行（tmux），二是让服务在服务器重启后自动恢复（systemd）。顺便聊聊面板和监控。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:11
msgid "tmux：终端\"续命\"神器"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:13
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"这是深度学习最实用的工具，没有之一。{ref}`ssh-setup`和{ref}`mosh-"
"basics`帮你连上服务器，但tmux让你的训练在你断开后继续跑。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:15
msgid "没有tmux的时候，你的工作流是这样的："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:17
msgid ""
"python train.py  # 训练开始，预计跑6小时\n"
"# ... 你去吃午饭了 ...\n"
"# 回来发现：终端超时断开了，训练白跑了6小时\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:23
msgid "有了tmux："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:25
msgid ""
"tmux new -s training  # 创建名为 training 的会话\n"
"python train.py        # 在tmux里启动训练\n"
"# Ctrl+B 然后按 D 断开（detach），会话还在跑\n"
"# 几小时后重新连上：\n"
"tmux attach -t training  # 回到训练现场，一切正常\n"
msgstr ""

