#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:56
msgid "真实世界的训练工作流"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:58
#, python-brace-format
msgid "结合mosh（{doc}`remote-access`）和tmux，你的日常会变成这样："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:60
msgid ""
"# 1. 用mosh连服务器（不怕切WiFi断连）\n"
"mosh user@server\n"
"\n"
"# 2. 创建tmux会话\n"
"tmux new -s experiment-0429\n"
"\n"
"# 3. 启动训练\n"
"python train.py --config configs/experiment.toml\n"
"\n"
"# 4. Ctrl+B → D 断开，关掉笔记本电脑走人\n"
"\n"
"# 5. 晚上回家，重新连上服务器\n"
"mosh user@server\n"
"tmux attach -t experiment-0429  # 训练还在跑，loss曲线实时更新\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:77
msgid "一个tmux新手最容易踩的坑"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:80
msgid ""
"不要在tmux里启动Jupyter "
"Notebook。因为Jupyter会打开浏览器，而tmux没有浏览器——它会卡住。正确的做法是在普通SSH窗口里开Jupyter（绑定127.0.0.1），然后通过SSH隧道访问。tmux只用来跑训练脚本、预处理数据这些不需要界面的任务。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:83
msgid "自定义tmux配置"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:85
msgid "如果你觉得默认的tmux界面太素，可以加个简单的配置："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:87
msgid ""
"# ~/.tmux.conf\n"
"# 让Ctrl+B更顺手（连续按两次更快）\n"
"set -g escape-time 0\n"
"\n"
"# 开启鼠标支持（可以用鼠标点窗口、拖分屏）\n"
"set -g mouse on\n"
"\n"
"# 窗口列表显示在底部\n"
"set -g status-position bottom\n"
"\n"
"# 每60秒自动刷新状态栏\n"
"set -g status-interval 60\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:102
msgid "改完配置后，在tmux里按 `Ctrl+B` → `:` → 输入 `source-file ~/.tmux.conf` 重载。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:106
msgid "systemd：让服务开机自己跑"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:108
msgid "tmux解决的是\"我走了训练别停\"的问题。还有一个更根本的问题：**服务器重启了，服务还能自己起来吗？**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:110
msgid "系统管理员不可能每次重启都手动去启动服务。systemd就是Linux的标准答案——它是一个\"服务管家\"，负责在开机时启动你指定的程序，并在程序崩溃后自动重启。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:112
msgid "写一个service文件"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:114
msgid "假设你想让Jupyter Notebook开机自启，可以写一个systemd service："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:116
msgid ""
"# /etc/systemd/system/jupyter.service\n"
"[Unit]\n"
"Description=Jupyter Notebook Server\n"
"After=network.target\n"
"\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Type=simple\n"
"User=user\n"
"WorkingDirectory=/home/user/projects\n"
"ExecStart=/home/user/.local/bin/jupyter notebook --ip=127.0.0.1 "
"--port=8888 --no-browser\n"
"Restart=on-failure\n"
"RestartSec=5\n"
"\n"
"[Install]\n"
"WantedBy=multi-user.target\n"
msgstr ""

