#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:144
msgid "管理service"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:146
msgid ""
"# 重新加载配置文件（改了service文件后必须执行）\n"
"sudo systemctl daemon-reload\n"
"\n"
"# 启用开机自启\n"
"sudo systemctl enable jupyter\n"
"\n"
"# 立即启动\n"
"sudo systemctl start jupyter\n"
"\n"
"# 查看状态\n"
"sudo systemctl status jupyter\n"
"\n"
"# 查看日志\n"
"sudo journalctl -u jupyter -f\n"
"\n"
"# 停止\n"
"sudo systemctl stop jupyter\n"
"\n"
"# 不想开机自启了\n"
"sudo systemctl disable jupyter\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:169
msgid "一个排错技巧"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:172
msgid ""
"`systemctl status` 显示的日志通常只保留最后几行。如果服务启动失败且原因不明显，用 `journalctl -u 服务名 -f`"
" 查看完整日志。`-f` 会持续跟踪新日志，你可以同时重启服务观察报错。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:175
msgid "训练脚本也适合用systemd吗？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:177
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"不适合。systemd适合**服务类程序**（Jupyter、API服务、监控Agent），不适合**一次性任务**（训练脚本）。训练脚本用{ref"
"}`tmux-basics`管理更灵活。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/server-management.md:179
msgid "为什么？因为训练脚本可能需要你手动中断（调参、看loss曲线、改代码），而systemd设计的是\"崩溃了就悄悄重试\"——你想要的停止可能被systemd误解为崩溃，然后自动重启。"
msgstr ""

